      "claim": "L6 napsagatran records show moderate intrinsic metabolic clearance in rat liver microsomes (14 ± 5.2 µl/min/mg, C84) and rat hepatocytes (5 ± 0.8 µl/min/10^6, C78), supporting some hepatic metabolic loss for this amidine-carboxylate peptidomimetic class, though rat-to-human transfer is uncertain.",
